{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "135",
 "name": "Dark Burrows",
 "file": "Map135_Dark_Burrows.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":-60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Overhang","descriptions":["Dead timber, perhaps stacked by previous hunters, is encased in ice and creates a snowy fence.  Strategically placed in relation to the steady wind currents, it provides a formidable barricade on the western edge of the overlook."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map136_VelaTohr_Overlook.xml"},
  {"id":2,"x":-80,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Poorly tanned hides have been stretched over tall wooden poles to form a windbreak around a jagged fissure.  Dry flakes of snow swirl into the tunnel with each gust of wind.  Footprints on the dusty stone floor bear mute witness to others who have passed this way.  The passage narrows slightly as it inclines steeply downward, away from the fissure."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":-60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Moisture seeps through cracks in the tunnel's roof, filling the air with dampness and the sound of dripping water.  A rope ladder, lashed securely to a large outcropping, leads down into the lower tunnels.  Though frayed, it appears sturdy enough to allow more climbers to pass along its length."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":-40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Damp walls close in tightly, thin rivulets of water trickling and dripping into puddles on the stone floor.  The rough granite has been partially smoothed into angular planes of chiseled rock.  A flickering torch dimly illuminates the tunnel and provides evidence that this area is regularly traveled."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":0,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["A single boulder, too large to lift or move, sits in the exact center of the cave.  Scraps of food litter the uneven floor between piles of makeshift straw bedding.  The low rocky ceiling and cramped quarters leave little room to move around."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":-20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Mounds of straw are arranged haphazardly around this dank cave, heaped with crudely tanned furs to form warm, if somewhat smelly, beds.  Moldering piles of refuse, tossed aside by now absent inhabitants, collect in the corners.  The visible portions of the stone floor are streaked with ash, leftovers from past fires and attempts at fires."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":-60,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Worn smooth over time, granite stairs lead down into the lower caverns.  A fraying rope ladder hangs against the wall, leading into the darkness overhead.  The corners of the cavern are filled with discarded rubbish."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":-40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Damp walls close in tightly, thin rivulets of water trickling and dripping into puddles on the stone floor.  The rough granite has been partially smoothed into angular planes of chiseled rock.  A flickering torch dimly illuminates the tunnel and provides evidence that this area is regularly traveled."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":9,"x":0,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Patches of lichen cling to the walls, giving off a pallid phosphorescent glow.  Deep gouges mar the surface of the rough stone where something made a futile attempt to extend this underground burrow.  Pile upon pile of ratty goatskins and straw cover the ground, making it nearly impossible to move about without finding some sort of makeshift bedding underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":-20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Various crude fletching tools and supplies lie scattered around the area, showing signs of frequent use.  Unstrung longbows are racked on the weapons stands lining the cavern walls.  Wood shavings and bone chips litter the floor around benches drawn up around the firepit in the center of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":-60,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Carved from the solid bedrock, a switchback of granite stairs zigzags up the northern wall while more steps cut into the cliff face lead down to the space below.  The wide ledge offers access to caves to the east and southwest.  Clusters of wickedly curved fangs decorated with black beads hang from the tops of poles leaning against the cavern walls along the ledge."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":-80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Swirls and scuffs in the dust on the floor testify to vigorous action by large feet.  Deep gouges inflicted by heavy objects wielded with unimaginable strength scar the walls of what can only be a training ground.  Riddled with broken arrows, a target dummy is wedged into a tight corner."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":-40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Wedged into the corners of the room, crude wooden bins hold withered carrots and moldy onions, wrinkled potatoes oozing reddish-brown liquid, and weevil-filled bags of coarsely ground flour.  Animal carcasses are slung from rusty hooks embedded in the ceiling.  The floor is sticky underfoot, though it's hard to tell in the dim light whether spilled food or blood is the cause.  Low benches surround a long granite block that serves as a table.  Some sort of brownish crust speckles the top of the rough stone."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":14,"x":-60,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Sloping downward to the east, a narrow ledge runs along the wall.  Beneath it, a sheer drop-off plunges dizzyingly into darkness, offering no purchase to climb down into the depths.  Some steps have been crudely cut into the side of the cliff face above, rising in a series of narrow switchbacks."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":-40,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Slow drops of water leak from the ceiling and strike the floor with soft splats that echo through the tunnel.  Luminescent lichen flourishes in the damp environment, splotching the wall with dimly glowing streaks of blue-green.  Tiny mushrooms poke up from the moss alongside the wall.  The top of a ladder rests against the ledge, secured to the rock with rusted iron spikes."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":-40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Spidery cracks run across the walls, and one of the larger fissures sports a small colony of moss.  The dust on the floor shows scuffed trails between a rickety ladder and the tunnel stretching to the northeast.  Anchored by a large boulder, a rope braided from vines leads down into the pit dominating the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":17,"x":-20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Chisel marks score the rock where ceiling and walls have been altered to enlarge the tunnel for easier passage.  Clumps of luminescent lichen illuminate the dark stone, causing flecks of mica to glint erratically like spirits trying to manifest just beneath the surface of the granite."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":0,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Signs of intelligent life are apparent in the tunnels.  The ceiling of this roughly worked passage is more even, the cave floor more regular, than any natural fissure.  Long, sweeping femurs and radii reinforce the walls, cemented into place to give the impression of some gargantuan serpent's rib cage viewed from within.  A faint whiff of smoke drifts past, carrying the promise of heat to drive away the mountain's pervasive chill from weary limbs."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":20,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The walls in this part of the cave are decorated with crude patterns.  Although primitive in design, the patterns are intricately painted in streaks of ash-black and rusty brown.  Bones have been attached to the walls, but the effect seems more decorative than structural.  Polished to a gleaming white, the bones glitter in the dim light of the banked fire in the center of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Pile upon pile of poorly tanned hides cover the ground, making it nearly impossible to move about without finding some sort of skin underfoot.  In the center of the cave, an unscraped goatskin is stretched tautly over a makeshift frame."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":40,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Various stone and steel mining equipment lies scattered around the room, bearing the dents and scars of frequent use.  Well-braced crossbeams are spaced out along this section of the tunnel, occasionally creaking in reminder of the tremendous weight they are supporting.  A ragged hide flap covers an opening in the south wall."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Thin trickles of water creep down the walls, feeding the pool that fills most of this cavern.  The oily surface gleams faintly in the subdued glow of the reflected firelight from the south.  Despite the noxious odor of the water, the multitude of tracks on the muddy floor indicates that the pool is a popular place with the denizens of the tunnels."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":0,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Compared to the rest of the living quarters, this area is neatly arranged.  A small pile of hay rests against one wall, and a pallet of furs is pushed up against the other.  Between the two sits a flat boulder covered with small bundles of twigs and a piece of flint."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":24,"x":0,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Mounds of hides fill the modest sized cavern, each apparently a separate sleeping space.  The lumpy piles are all empty, with no sign of their residents' current whereabouts.  Crude boxes clutter the area, providing a modicum of storage."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":25,"x":-20,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The rough granite walls of the cavern stretch into darkness.  The faint tang of guano is carried on a draft from some deeper part of the passage.  A crude rope braided from vines tacitly invites exploration of the area above."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":26,"x":0,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Although lost to sight in the darkness shrouding the ceiling, the scratching of claws on rock and the quiet squeaks of bats can be clearly heard.  Every visible surface of tunnel is streaked with guano that fills the air with an acrid odor."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":20,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["A shifting flock of large bats blankets the cavern's ceiling.  Occasionally, one of the creatures flexes its wings with a papery rustle.  Other, less readily identifiable sounds tease along the edge of hearing, distorted by the echoing tunnels."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":20,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Cave Mouth","descriptions":["The cave mouth opens into a broad interior passage that extends out of sight in the darkness to the north.  Slow drops of water fall from the ceiling, striking the floor with a splat that echoes off the rock walls.  A low, breathy chittering accompanies the rustling of leathery wings overhead.  Underfoot, bat guano covers the floor and holds the tracks of some large, bipedal creature."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":29,"x":40,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A narrow track ends abruptly where a massive shoulder of black granite juts from the side of the mountain.  Part of the cliff has collapsed, leaving a great jumble of fallen rock that partially blocks a dark cave mouth.  Sheltered from the sun's cruel light by the stony slopes, a thick blanket of yellow-green lichen spreads over much of the area."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map134_Blighted_Tangle.xml"},
  {"id":30,"x":40,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Illuminating patches of lichen cling to the walls, giving off a pallid phosphorescent glow.  A soft scratching sound can be heard coming from somewhere nearby, although between the echo of dripping water and the dim surroundings, the source cannot be easily pinpointed."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":31,"x":60,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Signs point to something or someone bent on improving upon nature's design, transforming these subterranean tunnels from an uninhabited warren into a permanent lair.  Crooked timbers reinforce stone walls and some attempt has been made to level the floor.  A ragged hide flap covers an opening in the north wall."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":32,"x":80,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["A vile combination of wood smoke, unwashed bodies, rotting garbage and bat guano fills the area with a stomach-churning aroma.  The air itself has an oily feel, leaving a film on the skin and clothing of anyone attempting to pick their way through the piles that obstruct the burrow."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":33,"x":80,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Dim light filters in through the opening.  The granite walls look different here, shifting from shades of black to light greys and blues.  The colors resolve into a faded mural emblazoned across the surface.  Though difficult to encompass with a casual glance, the image shows two groups: one is near the tunnel opening while the other is much farther away.  A two-headed adder separates the groups."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":34,"x":100,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Box Canyon","descriptions":["Gutted from the mountain by wind and ice, the granite walls of the canyon pinch inward overhead to create scant shelter from the elements.  Powdery grey moss dapples the lower surfaces and the ground is carpeted with wind-blown dirt and leaves.  Chilly gusts whistle through the narrow opening to the south, carrying a faint scent of pine sap.  To the north, the cleft narrows further to form a tunnel leading deeper into the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":35,"x":120,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["With the ridge dropping sharply towards the forest below, the narrow track hugs the mountain looming to the north.  Tenacious scrub pines cling to the stony ground, growing in defiance of strong winds and occasional rockslides.  Stubborn ice fills shadowed clefts in the granite cliffs.","Clinging precariously to the stony ground, scrub pines sway and rustle in time with the fickle wind.  Pebbles shift alarmingly underfoot and a few skitter over the edge of the ridge, a perilous reminder of rockslides.  Stubborn ice glints dully from the shadowed clefts in the granite cliffs."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map136_VelaTohr_Overlook.xml"},
  {"id":36,"x":80,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The tunnel narrows here, sloping sharply upwards to the north.  A thick layer of dust and guano coats the passage floor.  Tiny, glowing red eyes peer down from the cavern's ceiling, and a dry rustling fills the air like autumn leaves stirred by wind."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":37,"x":100,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Narrowing significantly, the dark stone enclosing the tunnel seems to press inwards, and a whisper of chill air swirls through the area from above.  The high-pitched chittering of bats fills the tunnel, yet every so often the noise ceases abruptly for several heartbeats before resuming."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":38,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The tunnel slopes down to the south, gradually curving out of sight.  Trickles of icy water seep from the rock walls, collecting in thin rivulets that spill down the floor of the steeply slanted passage.  A broken spear shaft lies amidst a scattering of well-gnawed bones.  Faint scratching and rustling noises echo up the tunnel from below."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":39,"x":100,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The geometrically precise tunnel forms a straight, if somewhat steep, passage through dark granite walls.  Scrapes mar the stone and disturb the dust lying thick on the floor, as if something large and heavy has been dragged this way."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":40,"x":100,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The rough texture of the stone walls is further marred by gouges and scorch marks.  Splintered bones and broken axes give mute testimony to a battle here in the past.  Chipped columns support a lintel over an elaborately carved granite door.  Set heart-high on a tall Elf, a glowing crystal embedded in the door bathes the area with an eldritch light."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":41,"x":60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Corbelled stone supports the tunnel's vaulted ceiling, straining against the pull of gravity attempting to collapse the passage beneath the weight of the mountain.  A thin layer of ice covers the path, making the floor slick and treacherous.  Sculpted from the walls, a pair of frost-coated pillars glitter in the pale light shed by a glowing crystal embedded in the carved granite door."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map139_Adders_Nest.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Blight Bats","x":30,"y":230,"z":0},
  {"text":"Blight Ogres","x":-10,"y":90,"z":0}
 ]
}
